Key Takeaway

Microsoft Entra ID provides centralized identity and access management for modern cloud environments. By effectively managing users, groups, licenses, devices, and governance controls, organizations can strengthen security, simplify administration, and ensure users have the appropriate level of access needed to perform their responsibilities.
